langapp — third-party data attribution

This file records attribution obligations for imported reference data served
by the API. See data/sources.json for full provenance (source, license,
version, download date) of every dataset in the import pipeline; this file
covers only the sources whose license requires a standing attribution notice
and that are actually live in the running app today.

